    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Guides creation of Qiskit quantum circuits with gates, measurements, parameters, and composition.",
      "Explains sampler and estimator primitives for local simulation and IBM Quantum Runtime execution.",
      "Shows transpilation and optimization choices for hardware-aware circuit preparation.",
      "Covers visualization for circuits, histograms, quantum states, and backend maps.",
      "Provides examples for VQE, QAOA, Grover search, chemistry, and quantum machine learning.",
      "Documents backend selection, job management, sessions, batch execution, and troubleshooting."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "It is reference guidance only and does not execute circuits by itself.",
